@anon.d1ff9934ece6813bf2a30f9ce237ed68.2105 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [472 x i8] }> <{ [472 x i8] c"# `async_fn_traits`\0A\0ASee Also: [`fn_traits`](../library-features/fn-traits.md)\0A\0A----\0A\0AThe `async_fn_traits` feature allows for implementation of the [`AsyncFn*`] traits\0Afor creating custom closure-like types that return futures.\0A\0A[`AsyncFn*`]: ../../std/ops/trait.AsyncFn.html\0A\0AThe main difference to the `Fn*` family of traits is that `AsyncFn` can return a future\0Athat borrows from itself (`FnOnce::Output` has no lifetime parameters, while `AsyncFn::CallFuture` does).\0A" }>, align 1
